        Title="Description"
        Type="Description"
        Ordinal="0">&lt;p&gt;Use after free in Windows Kernel allows an authorized attacker to elevate privileges locally.&lt;/p&gt;
</vuln:Note>
      <vuln:Note
        Title="FAQ"
        Type="FAQ"
        Ordinal="10">&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What privileges could be gained by an attacker who successfully exploited this vulnerability?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
