        Type="Release Notes">
        <vuln:URL>https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/microsoft-365/security/defender-endpoint/manage-updates-baselines-microsoft-defender-antivirus?view=o365-worldwide</vuln:URL>
        <vuln:ProductID>11902</vuln:ProductID>
