        Title="Description"
        Type="Description"
        Ordinal="0">&lt;p&gt;Insufficient ui warning of dangerous operations in Microsoft Edge (Chromium-based) allows an unauthorized attacker to perform spoofing over a network.&lt;/p&gt;
